  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c26c088b-26c4-559c-ba0e-880a7cf17b82" activityNameId="86b700dc-f3bd-5a8c-ab08-24fdcb536539" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Road vehicle plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Road vehicle plant
All data refer to one plant with an assumed life span of 50 years and a yearly output of 22918 vehicles. Further assumptions: 70% of the built up area is occupied with building halls and 30% are used for office buildings (multi storey buildings) with an assumed height between the floors of 2 .7m and an average of 5 floors. The remaining sealed area is modelled as road and parking infrastructure.;
UUID: add62058-528c-3255-b17d-65d0a77cc3d9
The inventory includes construction of buildings, roads and parking on the manufacturing site. Also, land occupation and transformation are accounted for. Furthermore, the disopsal of material and enregy expenditures due to disposal activities are included. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Building data represents conditions of the 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling:  Land use data represents two plants in the lorry production (inal ssembly and maufacturing of metal parts). The yearly production is about 22000 heavy duy vehicles.  A 50 year life span of the infrastructure is assumed. Data fo buildings on site is based on own assumptions.  
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_add62058-528c-3255-b17d-65d0a77cc3d9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
